ill lack data on C's adaptability and attention to detail, the evidence we have\u2014100% reliability, positive crew atmosphere, technical competence, stress resilience, quick correct decisions\u2014outweigh the concerns about his communication style and egocentric attitude, especially compared to B's nasty remarks and D's arrogance and lack of reliability. Therefore I keep my vote for Candidate C.\"\n\nMake sure METADATA_JSON vote is Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
